B.bgw=new A.bP("What it proves: the organization did a risk assessment, picked controls from Annex A (the 2022 revision defines 93 controls in four themes), and documented which it applies, and why it excluded the rest, in a Statement of Applicability. An organization does not implement all 93. It picks based on its own risk assessment. So the certificate proves process discipline over a defined scope, not that any specific control you care about is in place.",null)
