B.bML=new A.oa("Healthcare and hospitals","The full clinical stack: WMTS telemetry, medical-device EMC, RTLS grade, zero-tolerance roaming, four authorities, ICRA and ILSM during construction","Healthcare Wi-Fi; Know Before You Go: Site Access")
