B.Cc=s(['Permission to install that specific listed device, in that specific Division or Zone, wired per its control drawing. It is not a blanket "safe anywhere" stamp. A Div 2 device is not approved for Div 1, and the gas or dust group and temperature class still have to match the specific atmosphere.','Purpose-built rated APs are real. Cisco\'s Catalyst IW9167E-HZ ("Heavy Duty") is certified Class I Div 2, ATEX Zone 2/22, and IECEx, for example. A second pattern puts a standard AP inside a certified Ex-rated enclosure with the antenna routed out through certified glands. Both patterns exist, so know which one a spec sheet is describing.'],t.s)
