B.Co=s(["It is where mounting-height reality shows up. A 9 ft grid ceiling and a 22 ft open-to-deck warehouse are different coverage problems.","It is where physical conflicts surface on paper. An AP proposed dead-center of a room may collide with a diffuser, a light troffer, a sprinkler, or a soffit. Overlay your AP locations on the RCP and resolve the conflict before rough-in.","Ceiling construction type (lay-in grid, hard-lid drywall, open plenum, clouds) drives the mounting method and back-box coordination."],t.s)
