B.bl2=new A.AL("GPS / GNSS","Mid-L-band, between sub-GHz and cellular mid-band.",B.aGq,"GLONASS, Galileo, BeiDou, and NavIC overlap this L-band (about 1.1-1.6 GHz) with their own offsets. L1 (about 1.575 GHz) is the one a Wi-Fi pro should know: the band GPS jammers and bad cabling disturb.")
