B.bl_=new A.AL("2.4 GHz ISM","The crowded one: 2.400-2.4835 GHz, all shared.",B.aSl,"In 2.4 GHz, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Zigbee/Thread, and ovens all sit on top of each other in 83.5 MHz. The single most contested neighborhood in the chart.")
