B.ad1=new A.iJ("MA-L / MA-M / MA-S","IEEE assignment tiers: MA-L (large, 24-bit OUI, ~16.7M addresses), MA-M (medium, 28-bit, ~1M addresses), MA-S (small, 36-bit, 4096 addresses). MA-S and MA-M share a base OUI across organizations.","IEEE Registration Authority")
