B.E5=s(["Assuming the rack is tapped. Many modern racks ship as bare square holes with no cage nuts included. Show up without cage nuts and you cannot mount anything. Confirm the rack hole type before install day.","Mixing 10-32 and 12-24. They look near-identical and cross-thread when forced, the most damaging hardware error. Match the screw to the tap; when in doubt, use a square-hole rack with the right cage nut."],t.s)
